ur-galleries","source_title":"About Our Galleries | SUNY Oneonta","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Enter the Fine Arts Center from Ravine Parkway; the gallery is just past Martin-Mullen. Check exhibition timing before going.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hartwick-yager-museum","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Yager Museum of Art & Culture","title":"Browse Yager’s five galleries","subtitle":"Hartwick College, Oneonta","notes":"Plan a daytime visit with friends and move through the museum’s art and cultural collections, including exhibitions drawn from regional and Indigenous material.","short_summary":"A nearby college museum with free admission for all visitors.","evidence_claim":"Hartwick College states that admission to the Yager Museum of Art & Culture is free to all visitors.","source_url":"https://www.hartwick.edu/campus-life/arts-culture/yager-museum/visit-mueum/","source_title":"Visit the Museum | Hartwick College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The museum’s posted summer schedule is Wednesday–Saturday, 11 a.m.–4 p.m.; confirm current hours before traveling.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"suny-oneonta-milne-library-community-borrower","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Milne Library","title":"Choose books for a shared read","subtitle":"Milne Library","notes":"Browse the stacks together and, if eligible, apply at the circulation desk for a Community Borrower card to take selected materials home.","short_summary":"A campus library visit that can include no-charge community borrowing.","evidence_claim":"SUNY Oneonta says Community Borrower cards are issued at Milne Library with no charge to the borrower.","source_url":"https://suny.oneonta.edu/why-oneonta/student-success/academic-support/library","source_title":"Library | SUNY Oneonta","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Community borrowers must complete the application process; ask the circulation desk about eligibility and current hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"suny-oneonta-college-camp-camping","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"College Camp","title":"Plan a permitted College Camp overnight","subtitle":"119 Hoffman Road","notes":"Coordinate a small group, get the required permit from the Outdoor Resource Center, and follow College Camp rules for a simple outdoor overnight.","short_summary":"College Camp camping uses a free permit obtained before the trip.","evidence_claim":"SUNY Oneonta states that all College Camp campers need a free camping permit from the Director of Outdoor Programs.","source_url":"https://suny.oneonta.edu/oneonta-auxiliary-services-oas/college-camp/activities","source_title":"College Camp Activities | SUNY Oneonta","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Obtain the free permit in advance from the Outdoor Resource Center in Hulbert Hall and comply with College Camp regulations.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"suny-oneonta-writing-assistance","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Writing Assistance","title":"Book a free writing consult","subtitle":"Student Learning Center, Milne Library","notes":"Schedule a session, bring a draft, and invite a classmate to compare feedback afterward; appointments are held in the Student Learning Center unless requested online.","short_summary":"No-charge one-on-one writing support in Milne Library.","evidence_claim":"SUNY Oneonta states that signing up for a Writing Assistance appointment w